{"name": "Glintseeker Island", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/59a21ca3ab30ff3126727b1f4bb3d556.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/59a21ca3ab30ff3126727b1f4bb3d556.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/59a21ca3ab30ff3126727b1f4bb3d556.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>singleplayer mining exploration adventure</strong>, you explore mysterious caves in search of ancient treasures and artefacts. Bring your excavated loot safely back to the surface and sell them to the local merchant, or use them to upgrade and enhance your hammers\u00a0with gemstones  at the blacksmith. Rest assured, you will need all the help you can get to uncover the island's long-buried secrets and overcome a <strong>mysterious threat</strong> from below!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you loved the caves in <i>Stardew Valley</i>, Glintseeker Island takes you on a similar journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/3954accc0478cd422ca854f3f8e690b7.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/3954accc0478cd422ca854f3f8e690b7.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/3954accc0478cd422ca854f3f8e690b7.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be strategic when mining. Use your hammers carefully to unearth treasures and artefacts hidden under different layers of rock of varying hardness. But beware, with each hammer hit, the wall loses stability and gets closer to collapse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/da06d21453b45dd71ef9d3f79885911e.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/da06d21453b45dd71ef9d3f79885911e.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/da06d21453b45dd71ef9d3f79885911e.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>hammers</strong> are an integral part of the game.\u00a0Start off with only your trusty pickaxe to defend yourself, and as you progress unlock new hammers with special abilities to traverse the underground! You also use them to excavate treasures inside the\u00a0<strong>mining minigame</strong>. So choose wisely which hammers you bring with you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/ace3c4d835ca6f7358360822c02a64e7.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/ace3c4d835ca6f7358360822c02a64e7.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/ace3c4d835ca6f7358360822c02a64e7.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend deeper and deeper into the mysterious caves and discover unique cave biomes, each with its own gimmicks and twists. Better treasures and also more dangers await the deeper you go. Every 10 floors, you will face challenging bosses or puzzling obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/153d8b996df28c7333a7c10cea189e14.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/153d8b996df28c7333a7c10cea189e14.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/153d8b996df28c7333a7c10cea189e14.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand your ground against the island\u2019s ancient guardians deep below the surface. Slash through swarming underground creatures and prepare for intense boss battles every 10 floors. Each one is more than just a test of your hammers and upgrades - you will need clever strategies and puzzle-solving skills to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Excavate Treasures:</strong> Dig up countless treasures in a captivating excavation minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Hammers:</strong> Find over 12 legendary hammers, upgrade and enhance them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Caves:</strong> Explore diverse biomes with unique enemies &amp; loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat and Boss Battles:</strong> Fight underground creatures and face challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Manage limited space and upgrade your backpack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Backpack Puzzles:</strong> Solve item puzzles in your tile-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Village Progression:</strong> Complete quests, restore the village and upgrade your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles and Story:</strong> Solve puzzles and uncover the island\u2019s hidden history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pet Shadow:</strong> Yes, you can pet the dog. \u2705</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/1cc34bb46e59b1f72d755f0f7b1ec89b.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/1cc34bb46e59b1f72d755f0f7b1ec89b.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/1cc34bb46e59b1f72d755f0f7b1ec89b.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Descend into mysterious caves with countless treasures to excavate in a mining exploration adventure. Upgrade your gear, fight bosses, uncover secrets and save the island from an ancient threat below!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/d17f21435490b8a9dc659e31560b8cff07a95ad2/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1785742966", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action-Adventure", "Mining", "Exploration", "Top-Down", "Adventure", "Puzzle"], "developers": "Half Soup Labs", "publishers": "Half Soup Labs", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3122600", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 February 2026 - Request Access\n\n16 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/wAhggRE-0OU", "first_seen": 1770850800.0, "review_rank": 1226}